<sect1 id="UdpDelaySimRunner_8h_1DESCRIPTION">
<title>DESCRIPTION</title>
<para>This <ref refid="classLtpTimerManager" kindref="compound">LtpTimerManager</ref> templated class encapsulates a shared boost::asio::deadline_timer for use with all LTP sessions within a single-threaded LTP sender &quot;exclusive or&quot; receiver engine. The class uses/shares the user&apos;s provided boost::asio::deadline_timer and hence uses/shares the user&apos;s provided boost::asio::io_service. This is a single threaded class designed to run and be called from one ioService thread only. Time expiration is based on 2*(one_way_light_time + one_way_margin_time) Explicit template instantiation is defined in its .cpp file for idType of <ref refid="structLtp_1_1session__id__t" kindref="compound">Ltp::session_id_t</ref> and uint64_t. The idType is a &quot;serial number&quot; used to associate an expiry time with. </para>
</sect1>
